    {
      "id": "n2",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "label": "About this template",
      "s": {
        "text": "At each busbar of Connection point this connects a test generator at unity power factor and searches its largest output for which the load flow converges, no line or 2-winding transformer is above 100 % and every busbar stays between 0.9 and 1.1 p.u., turning the generators already dispatched down pro rata by the same amount (delete Other generators to let the slack take it, as for an upstream grid). Each busbar gets a row with its hosting capacity and a bar chart is drawn at the end; the dispatch is put back and the test generator deleted. Fill in the project, then narrow the busbars and set the search range and limits to your network."
      },
      "pin": [],
      "sv": 1
    },
